# Square 1's priority rules, over song $04 (main caves).
# tick 60: beam shot ($07). tick 63: a jump ($01) does not cut a beam shot
# off, so the shot plays on. tick 90: the jump again, with nothing playing.
# tick 100: an uncrouch ($04) does not cut off a jump (anything from $04 up
# keeps playing). tick 130: a missile-drop pickup ($0C); tick 133: a beam
# shot ($07) cannot interrupt it. tick 160: health change ($18); tick 161:
# a missile ($08) cannot interrupt that either. tick 200: a spazer shot
# ($0B); tick 203: a jump does cut the spazer off. tick 230: a missile
# ($08), stopped by $FF at tick 240. Five seconds.
